{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "oan-da-surveys",
    "name": "OAN DA Surveys",
    "description": "Survey templates, assigned tasks, responses, validation, idempotency and XLSX export (FR-09d).\n\nBase path: /api/v1/da-services\n\n## Run order (happy path)\n1. Login as Supervisor (or Admin with woreda set)\n2. Create template → stores survey_id\n3. List templates / Get template\n4. Login as DA in the same Woreda (or keep Supervisor)\n5. List surveys / Get survey\n6. Submit response → stores response_id\n7. List responses / Results / Export\n8. (Optional) Patch close\n9. Negative and security cases\n\n## Confirmed rules exercised here\n- DA capture is limited to farmers in the DA's Effective Kebele assignments.\n- One completed response per farmer per template, across all DAs (409).\n- Farmer location is stored from the farmer reference, not the collector DA.\n- `client_op_id` replay is scoped to survey + collector; mismatches are 409.\n- Excel export is Supervisor / Executive / Admin only.\n- Executive sees /surveys in GET /me.\n\n## Auth\nNative DocTypes. Bearer {{access_token}} only. No staff CSRF.\n\n## Docs\n- docs/surveys-integration.md\n- docs/surveys-frontend.md\n- docs/api-da-screens.md §2.16\n\nCreating a template and submitting a response write real rows. Use a disposable site.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
